00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:16.740
I am guessing you are from Bratislava but
what do you think about us Hungarians in the

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.910
South of Slovakia? - from a South Slovak Hungarian.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.830
Well, since this is a history channel, we
might as well have a small history lesson.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:28.490
Keep in mind that I am VERY oversimplifying
this issue and if you want to know more as

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.990
always research it yourself and be aware of
people’s biases.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:36.240
Also I am going to be just talking about Slovak/Hungarian
relations even though lots of the stuff that

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.310
happened is similar to other areas hungarians
controlled.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.590
So to start of with when the Magyar (the people
called hungarians in English) tribes came

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:45.180
in to the pannonian basin in the very late
9th early 10th century.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:50.080
They conquered the area around the pannonian
basin, including the lands of modern day Slovakia

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:52.360
along with the slavs that lived there.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:56.760
For more information on how the Slavs got
there watch my early western slavic video.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:05:00.840
So ever since that time (disregarding few
short occupations) Slovakia was under Hungarian

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.970
control until the end of WW1 in 1918.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:07.681
And this was direct control of Slovakia, there
was no autonomy like the Croatians had for

00:05:07.681 --> 00:05:08.681
example.

00:05:08.681 --> 00:05:12.990
At the very best Slovaks where just seen as
Hungarians that spoke funny and at the worst

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:17.410
they were treated as second class citizens
that were often times discriminated against

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:19.180
both politically and socially.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:24.060
However contrary to some modern Slovak believes,
Slovaks were always considered as hungarian

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.060
citizens.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:29.680
What however did happen was magyarization,
which is a word used to describe the convertian

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:33.560
of none Hungarians within hungary to be hungarians.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:38.370
But again contrary to popular believe magyarization
of Slovakia happened due to assimilation and

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:43.070
also political, economical and social pressures
put on the Slovaks by the Hungarians.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:49.160
It was a forced passive conversation not an
active “clencing one” for lack of a better

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.160
word.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.250
So you could always speak identify and live
as a Slovak normally, the hungarians just

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.910
made sure it was politically, economically,
and socially easier for you to just speak

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:01.040
and identify as a hungarian.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:06.090
So many people did and over a couple of generations
those people started to think of themselves

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.510
as Hungarians.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:11.840
However Slovakia is mostly mountains and it’s
hard to get a cell signal out there let alone

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.960
magyarize a couple of million Slovaks that
don’t even like you.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:19.410
So most magyarization all the way till the
end of WW1 happened in the lowlands.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:23.790
However Hungary was on the losing side of
WW1 and the slovaks that joined forces with

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.490
the Czechs where on the winning side.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.400
So they had the bigger leverage.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:32.320
And naturally as any winning country in a
war does, Czechoslovakia claimed lands much

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:36.910
larger than the actual area where the Slovaks
and Czechs lived at this point.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:42.900
So Slovakia now had a very sizeable Hungarian
minority and Czechs had a German minority.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:47.480
And now as it so often does in history the
pendulum swung the other way and partly out

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:52.490
of spite, partly out of revenge and partly
out of trying to stabilize the country Czechoslovaks

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:57.000
passed some anti minority laws, effecting
not just the Hungarians but also Germans and

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.910
any other minorities in the country.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:03.641
Arguably the height of these anti minority
laws was the Benes decrees after WW2 which

00:07:03.641 --> 00:07:07.160
continued in one way or another till the end
of the communist era.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.190
And now we’re here.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:13.070
With Slovakia still having around half a million
hungarians and one of them wrote me a question

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.010
asking me what I think of them.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:20.400
Well A. Considering all of this history that
happened and taking it to account, I think

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:25.720
we’re doing pretty well at coexisting specially
when compared to some other European areas.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:30.470
And B. I am going to say the same thing I
tweeted a couple months ago, and that is that

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:35.160
nationality and ethnicity shouldn't be treated
as the same thing and shouldn’t be mutually

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.090
exclusive because throughout most of history
they weren’t.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:43.140
You can be a perfectly proud even nationalistic
Swiss even though you’re ethnically Italian

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.900
or French or German, etc.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:49.840
We should be able to recognize and treat you
and other ethnic hungarians born and living

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:54.880
and working in Slovakia as normal slovak citizens
and at the same time even though you’re

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:58.790
ethnically hungarian you should be able to
be a proud Slovak citizen.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.100
After all we’re all part of the same country
and we should be working together to make

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.140
that country better for all of us.

