00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:41.870
What does your coat of arms mean?

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.130
My coat of arms is a combination of a lot
of things.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.970
First the escutcheon, escutcheon, escutcheon?

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:50.600
The shield in the middle.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:54.560
It’s starts of as a generic coat of arms
shield, with the blue mountains being taken

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.000
from the Slovak coat of arms and I added the
rivers running down valleys because i knew

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.100
I was going to do the cities series so I wanted
to symbolize the fact that cities were almost

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:05.640
always built on rivers.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:09.720
The 13 white and red stripes in the background
are taken from the American flag because that

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:10.720
is where I learned english.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:15.029
And the three towers or more accurately gates
are taken from the Bratislava’s coat of

00:10:15.029 --> 00:10:18.120
arms because I was born and live in Bratislava.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:21.790
Going back and looking at the entire coat
of arms, this is where the definitions get

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:22.790
more generic.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:26.320
For example the swords and the helmet I just
added because they look cool.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:30.280
I added the owls holding up the shield to
symbolize knowledge because in the end my

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:32.020
channel is an educational one.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:36.320
And the white and black Czech or more accurately
Bohemian lions I added to symbolize duality

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.740
which is often times a recurring theme in
historical symbols.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:43.780
But I also added them because Czech Republic
and Slovakia are kind of like brothers and

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.149
I am still a bit salty that we split up.

00:10:46.149 --> 00:10:50.240
There's a reason the quote goes divide and
conquer not unite and conquer.

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:51.240
But i digress.

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:56.140
Lastly at the bottom it says, Cognitio, Unitas,
Persisto, which loosely translates from latin

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.370
in to Knowledge, Unity, Perseverance, which
is kind of self explanatory.

